<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.49 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.86 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.38 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Sales		   20.57 vs  16.95</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.05 vs   4.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.93 vs   6.90</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.26 vs   9.76</p>
<p> Sales		   97.24 vs  79.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Farm Food SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
